# The dev profile (the default). `id-effect dev` creates a localhost development certificate
# (13 days, rotated before it expires) and passes it as TLS_CERT_FILE / TLS_KEY_FILE, so the
# service answers https://localhost:8080 over HTTP/2 and HTTP/3. Without it (plain `cargo run`)
# the service serves plain HTTP and the posture report says HTTP/3 has no certificate.
#
# The prod profile refuses that certificate (posture probe "no dev certificate").
